                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \star_{\tfrac{1}{2}\pi}
            %p
              This is the case notably for
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wick+algebras"} Wick algebras
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebras+of+quantum+observables"} algebras of quantum observables
